  "tidy.title": "Auto tidy",
  "tidy.help": "A preset tidies at once by its rules (including step 02's Tidy up). With 'Applies to' on the whole model it changes the model's settings; on the picked patches only the patches clicked in 3D and their surroundings change (the settings stay). Pointing at a preset shows what it would change first. In the 💬 consult, describe what you want or press 🔍: Claude looks at the model from several sides and changes the same knobs, or proposes changes. Changed fields are yellow; ↩ undoes the whole change. Tidying again starts over from the colours before the tidy. A zoomed-in view goes to Claude too. Without a Claude login on this computer, the consult takes your own API key.",
  "tidy.helpPlain": "A preset tidies at once by its rules (including step 02's Tidy up). With 'Applies to' on the whole model it changes the model's settings; on the picked patches only the patches clicked in 3D and their surroundings change (the settings stay). Pointing at a preset shows what it would change first. Changed fields are yellow; ↩ undoes the whole change. Tidying again starts over from the colours before the tidy.",
